      "body": "Alphalogic Industries Limited announced a private placement of 1,800,000 Convertible Equity Warrants at a price per share of INR 28 per Warrant on receipt of amount at the rate of INR 7 per Warrant for gross proceeds of INR 12,600,000 on January 1, 2026. The Warrants are convertible into Common Shares of the company and have exercise price of INR 21. The transaction involve participation from returning investor Alphalogic Techsys Limited for 1,170,000 Warrants, individual investor Mrs. Neha Anshu Geol for 300,000 Warrants and new investor Vivaro Enterprises Limited for 330,000 Warrants.",
